{"hash": "4f51814d2bef3f1e", "kind": "tts", "payload": {"text": "Thank you, Emily. This is the Barclays fraud-prevention team, calling on a recorded line. I'm sorry to call you unexpectedly \u2014 we've spotted an urgent transaction on your account that may be fraudulent, and I'd like to check it with you. Is now an okay moment to talk?"}, "prev_hash": "d2d4b4d8ac54d4e3", "seq": 5, "session_id": "call_650399cc01", "ts": 1784893753643}
